# Force LF in every working tree, on every platform.
#
# `text=auto` alone is not enough: on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) it checks the
# sources out as CRLF, so concatenating them yields a byte-different index.html
# on each machine — spurious diffs on a generated file that IS committed. It also
# broke build.sh in Git Bash on the stray \r. Everything here is text served over
# HTTP, so LF everywhere is both correct and reproducible.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored/minified and binary: never touch, never diff
*.min.js -text -diff
*.png binary
